77 annotated conditions in the development set. N is the number (proportion) of conditions in the reference standard for which a contextual property was assigned a non-default value. The two definitions of scope are: six-token window (“stw”) and end-of-sentence (“eos”). The highest score for a given measure, report type, and contextual property is in bold.</p></caption><table frame="box" rules="all"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N</th><th colspan="2" valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1">Recall</th><th colspan="2" valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1">Precision</th><th colspan="2" valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1">F-measure</th></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">stw</th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">eos</th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">stw</th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">eos</th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">stw</th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">eos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="8" align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1"><bold>Development set: 2377 annotated conditions</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic toggle="yes">negated</italic></td><td align="right" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">491 / 21%</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">.96</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>.98</bold></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>.99</bold></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">.98</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">.97</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>.98</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="lef